## 3. eBPF Layer – Surgical Precision

### 3.1 Map Hardening (no `BPF_F_NO_PREALLOC`)
```c
// ebpf/xdp_filter.c
struct {
    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_LPM_TRIE);
    __uint(map_flags, BPF_F_NO_PREALLOC | BPF_F_RDONLY_PROG);
    __uint(max_entries, 1<<20);
    __type(key, struct bpf_lpm_trie_key_u32);
    __type(value, __u8); /* 0=drop, 1=pass */
} blackhole SEC(".maps");
```

### 3.2 Constant-blinding (anti-spectre)
```c
/* Use randomized cookie per load */
const volatile __u32 secret_cookie = 0; /* set via .rodata */
...
if (iph->daddr ^ secret_cookie) { ... }
```
```bash
# loader injects cookie
bpftool gen skeleton xdp_filter.o \
  | sed "s/secret_cookie = 0/secret_cookie = $(openssl rand -hex 4)/" \
  > xdp_filter.skel.h
```

