## 4. VPP Layer – NUMA-Aware, Zero-Copy

### 4.1 Node pinning (systemd slice)
```ini
# /etc/systemd/system/cerberus-vpp.service
[Unit]
Description=Cerberus-VPP datapath
After=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/bin/vpp -c /etc/vpp/startup.conf
CPUAffinity=2-7
MemoryDenyWriteExecute=true
RestrictRealtime=true
SystemCallFilter=@system-service
SystemCallArchitectures=native
```

### 4.2 Startup.conf tuned
```c
unix {
  nodaemon
  log /var/log/vpp/cerberus.log
  cli-listen /run/vpp/cli.sock
}
dpdk {
  dev 0000:19:00.0 {
    num-rx-queues 4
