## 6. Observability – Tamper-Proof Logs

### 6.1 Binary log format (zstd)
```go
// userspace/internal/logger/logger.go
type Entry struct {
    UnixNano int64
    Severity byte
    RuleID   uint64
    MsgLen   uint16
    Msg      [256]byte
}

func WriteZstd(w *zstd.Encoder, e *Entry) {
    _ = binary.Write(w, binary.LittleEndian, e)
}
```

### 6.2 logrotate + chattr
```bash
/var/log/cerberus/*.log {
    daily
    rotate 7
    compress
    postrotate
        chattr +i /var/log/cerberus/current.log
    endscript
}
```

